{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "enter-and-exit",
  "title": "Enter and exit",
  "group": "Motion",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "How things appear and disappear: overlays rise a few pixels and scale up from 0.96 on the smooth spring while they fade in fast; they leave in 180 ms on the exit curve, quieter than they came, along the same path. Things joining a list fade in from a small blur.",
    "id": "Cara sesuatu muncul dan menghilang: overlay naik beberapa piksel dan membesar dari 0,96 dengan smooth spring sambil cepat memudar masuk; overlay pergi dalam 180 ms dengan kurva keluar, lebih tenang daripada saat datang, lewat jalur yang sama. Butir yang bergabung ke daftar memudar masuk dari blur tipis."
  },
  "titleId": "Enter and exit",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A menu grows from its trigger",
        "desc": "Left menu grows from its top left corner; the right one, opened from the right edge, grows from its top right (`menu--right`). Both shrink back to where they came from in 180 ms.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" data-lds-menu=\"ee-sort\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Sort by<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu\" id=\"ee-sort\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); left: 0;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\">Report date</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\">Kecamatan</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\">Recently added</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n    <button class=\"icon-btn\" data-lds-menu=\"ee-more\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"More actions\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"ee-more\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Rename</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">content_copy</span>Duplicate</button>\n      <div class=\"menu__sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu__item menu__item--danger\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dialog and drawer",
        "desc": "The dialog fades in fast (160 ms) while it settles from slightly small and low on the smooth spring; the scrim takes 240 ms. Closing reverses in 180 ms on the exit curve. The drawer slides in from the right and leaves to the right.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <p class=\"card__title\">Micro business permit service</p>\n    <div class=\"docs-row\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ee-dialog\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Rename service</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ee-drawer\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tune</span>Filters</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ee-dialog\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"ee-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ee-dialog-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <h3 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ee-dialog-t\">Rename service</h3>\n    <p class=\"dialog__body\">Residents see the new name the next time they open the app.</p>\n    <div class=\"control\" style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><input aria-label=\"Service name\" value=\"Micro business permit service\" data-lds-autofocus></div>\n    <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-close>Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" data-lds-close>Save name</button></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ee-drawer\"></div>\n  <aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"ee-drawer\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ee-drawer-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"sheet__head\" style=\"margin: 0;\"><h3 class=\"sheet__title\" id=\"ee-drawer-t\">Filters</h3><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Close filters\" data-lds-close style=\"margin: -10px -10px -10px 0;\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--block\" style=\"margin-top: auto;\" data-lds-close>Show 8 services</button>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A toast arrives and leaves",
        "desc": "A toast rises 24 px from below on the smooth spring; after four seconds it fades out in 180 ms. Send several: older ones tuck behind and shrink 5 % each.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\" style=\"height: 300px;\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <p class=\"card__title\">Citizen report</p>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" onclick=\"import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.toast({ title: 'Draft saved', icon: 'check_circle', container: this.closest('.viewport') }))\">Save draft</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"toaster\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "import { toast } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\ntoast({ title: 'Draft saved', icon: 'check_circle' });"
      },
      {
        "title": "One item joins a list",
        "desc": "A new file row fades in from a 4 px blur and rises 4 px (240 ms, enter curve). The rows already there do not move except to make room.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"file-row\"><span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span><span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">damaged-road-photo.jpg</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">1.2 MB</span></span><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Remove damaged-road-photo.jpg\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div></div>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"align-self: flex-start;\" onclick=\"const list = this.previousElementSibling; const row = list.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true); row.querySelector('.file-row__name').textContent = 'attachment-' + (list.children.length + 1) + '.pdf'; row.querySelector('.file-row__meta').textContent = '340 KB'; list.append(row);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span>Add a file</button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Page modal",
        "desc": "A native `dialog.modal` rises from 8 px below and 0.96 on the smooth spring, its backdrop fades over 240 ms; it leaves to 0.97 in 180 ms. Below 600 px it becomes a bottom sheet that rises and drops.",
        "html": "<button class=\"btn btn--secondary\" data-lds-modal=\"ee-modal\">Report a mistake</button>\n<dialog class=\"modal\" id=\"ee-modal\" aria-labelledby=\"ee-modal-t\">\n  <button class=\"icon-btn dialog__close\" data-lds-modal-close aria-label=\"Close\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n  <h2 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ee-modal-t\">Report a mistake</h2>\n  <p class=\"dialog__body\">Tell us which detail on your local tax bill is wrong and what it should say.</p>\n  <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary\" data-lds-modal-close>Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-lds-modal-close>Send report</button></div>\n</dialog>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Menu tumbuh dari pemicunya",
        "desc": "Menu kiri tumbuh dari sudut kiri atasnya; menu kanan, yang dibuka dari tepi kanan, tumbuh dari sudut kanan atasnya (`menu--right`). Keduanya mengecil kembali ke asalnya dalam 180 ms.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" data-lds-menu=\"ee-sort\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Urutkan<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu\" id=\"ee-sort\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); left: 0;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\">Tanggal lapor</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\">Kecamatan</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\">Baru ditambahkan</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n    <button class=\"icon-btn\" data-lds-menu=\"ee-more\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Aksi lainnya\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"ee-more\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Ganti nama</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">content_copy</span>Gandakan</button>\n      <div class=\"menu__sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu__item menu__item--danger\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dialog dan drawer",
        "desc": "Dialog cepat memudar masuk (160 ms) sambil menetap dari posisi sedikit kecil dan rendah dengan smooth spring; scrim butuh 240 ms. Saat ditutup, gerakannya berbalik dalam 180 ms dengan kurva keluar. Drawer bergeser masuk dari kanan dan pergi ke kanan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <p class=\"card__title\">Layanan izin usaha mikro</p>\n    <div class=\"docs-row\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ee-dialog\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Ganti nama layanan</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ee-drawer\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tune</span>Filter</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ee-dialog\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"ee-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ee-dialog-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <h3 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ee-dialog-t\">Ganti nama layanan</h3>\n    <p class=\"dialog__body\">Warga melihat nama baru saat mereka membuka aplikasi berikutnya.</p>\n    <div class=\"control\" style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><input aria-label=\"Nama layanan\" value=\"Layanan izin usaha mikro\" data-lds-autofocus></div>\n    <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-close>Batal</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" data-lds-close>Simpan nama</button></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ee-drawer\"></div>\n  <aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"ee-drawer\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ee-drawer-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"sheet__head\" style=\"margin: 0;\"><h3 class=\"sheet__title\" id=\"ee-drawer-t\">Filter</h3><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Tutup filter\" data-lds-close style=\"margin: -10px -10px -10px 0;\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--block\" style=\"margin-top: auto;\" data-lds-close>Tampilkan 8 layanan</button>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Toast datang dan pergi",
        "desc": "Toast naik 24 px dari bawah dengan smooth spring; setelah empat detik ia memudar keluar dalam 180 ms. Kirim beberapa: yang lebih lama terselip di belakang dan mengecil 5% masing-masing.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\" style=\"height: 300px;\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <p class=\"card__title\">Laporan warga</p>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" onclick=\"import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.toast({ title: 'Draf tersimpan', icon: 'check_circle', container: this.closest('.viewport') }))\">Simpan draf</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"toaster\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "import { toast } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\ntoast({ title: 'Draf tersimpan', icon: 'check_circle' });"
      },
      {
        "title": "Satu butir bergabung ke daftar",
        "desc": "Baris berkas baru memudar masuk dari blur 4 px dan naik 4 px (240 ms, kurva masuk). Baris yang sudah ada tidak bergerak kecuali untuk memberi ruang.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"file-row\"><span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span><span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">foto-jalan-rusak.jpg</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">1,2 MB</span></span><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus foto-jalan-rusak.jpg\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div></div>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"align-self: flex-start;\" onclick=\"const list = this.previousElementSibling; const row = list.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true); row.querySelector('.file-row__name').textContent = 'lampiran-' + (list.children.length + 1) + '.pdf'; row.querySelector('.file-row__meta').textContent = '340 KB'; list.append(row);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span>Tambah berkas</button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Modal halaman",
        "desc": "`dialog.modal` bawaan naik dari 8 px di bawah dan skala 0,96 dengan smooth spring, backdrop-nya memudar selama 240 ms; modal pergi ke skala 0,97 dalam 180 ms. Di bawah 600 px modal menjadi bottom sheet yang naik dan turun.",
        "html": "<button class=\"btn btn--secondary\" data-lds-modal=\"ee-modal\">Laporkan kesalahan</button>\n<dialog class=\"modal\" id=\"ee-modal\" aria-labelledby=\"ee-modal-t\">\n  <button class=\"icon-btn dialog__close\" data-lds-modal-close aria-label=\"Tutup\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n  <h2 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ee-modal-t\">Laporkan kesalahan</h2>\n  <p class=\"dialog__body\">Sebutkan data yang salah pada tagihan pajak daerah Anda dan isi yang seharusnya.</p>\n  <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary\" data-lds-modal-close>Batal</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-lds-modal-close>Kirim laporan</button></div>\n</dialog>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { closeModal } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\n// Render .overlay > .overlay__panel while open; on close, play the exit first:\ncloseModal(overlayRef.current, () => setOpen(false));",
